  "label": "The cat is mapped as the subject of the textual statement 'power of christ does not compel this kitty'",
  "description": "The text 'power of christ does not compel this kitty' explicitly refers to the white cat as 'this kitty'. This creates an analogical mapping where the visual entity (the white cat) is identified as the subject of the textual statement. The meme uses the cat's indifferent demeanor to humorously represent the concept of non-compliance with divine authority, thereby mapping the cat's visual presence onto the textual subject 'this kitty'.",
